  + [supplied_inventory_assembly] is implemented under 9c92f968-054a-42de-a27f-90925bb5081e with parent-closed structural set semantics but no physical enumeration or completeness provenance

& [P3TS-002] is entry-before-descent reparse rejection
  + [formation] is complete
