  + [scanner_issuance_and_consumption] are absent

& [P3TS-011] is explicit non-atomic race boundary
  + [formation] is complete
  + [entry_local_assembly] is implemented without temporal claims
  + [pre_post_stability_reconciliation] is implemented and globally proven without temporal or provenance claims
  + [supplied_content_digest_binding] pure implementation, exact digest and binding behavior, focused tests, evidence, and global proof pass under 44749466-30d8-44e9-85b8-e51f1bafea33 without physical byte-read authority
  + [supplied_regular_file_projection] pure implementation, exact placement and binding behavior, focused tests, evidence, and global proof pass without physical path, Git mode, or traversal authority
  + [supplied_directory_projection] pure implementation and proof pass under 2f24b78e-90ab-4413-9189-2c2bbcf65187 with mandatory stability revalidation and no direct stable-pair, physical path, enumeration, or traversal authority
  + [supplied_root_projection] pure implementation and proof pass under 6af7c461-07ed-426c-9684-819405223bf6 with mandatory preflight and stability revalidation and no physical or temporal authority
  + [supplied_inventory_assembly] pure implementation preserves complete carriers and closes supplied-set duplicates, parents, structural order, ordinals, count, and byte totals without physical provenance
  + [supplied_ordered_inventory_digest] pure canonical ordered-sequence commitment is implemented and globally proven without physical provenance or completeness authority
  + [supplied_digest_reconciliation] pure current two-sided rederivation and exact-scope Equal or Different relation is implemented without acquisition order, temporal repetition, stability, double-inventory, or quiescence authority
  + [physical_inventory_repetition] is absent

