  + [formation] is complete
  + [compile_surface] is proven by cantor-windows-topology-abi-probe/0.2
  + [root_preflight_runtime] is locally proven under cantor-windows-platform-preflight-runtime/0.2
  + [scanner_runtime_implementation] is absent

